{% extends "base.html.jinja" %}
{# DECISIONS 0047. Built from GIFT_GUIDE_FROM (2026-11-27). The only Amazon
   links are the list's: search links, tagged, rel-marked, each with the
   labels the GA4 click handler reads. Same disclosure as /gear/, before the
   first link and after the last. #}
{% macro disclosure(anchor_id) %}
<p class="muted" id="{{ anchor_id }}">
  The gift links on this page are affiliate links: if you buy something after
  following one, this site earns a commission, and it costs you nothing extra.
  {{ amazon_disclosure }}
  {{ gear_endorsement }}
  <a href="{{ root }}privacy/#affiliate">More in the privacy policy</a>.
</p>
{% endmacro %}
{% block content %}
<h1>Gifts for trout anglers</h1>
<p class="lede">
  Practical ideas for someone who fishes for planted trout at a California
  lake or pond. Each one is useful whatever gear they already own,
  and each comes with a sentence on why it helps on the bank.
</p>
<p class="gear-label">Affiliate links</p>
{{ disclosure("gift-disclosure") }}
<p>
  Each link searches Amazon.com for that kind of item. It points to search
  results, not to any one product, and this page names no brand and gives no
  prices. Prices change, so check the current price before you buy.
</p>

<ul>
  {% for g in gifts %}
  <li><a href="{{ g.url }}" rel="{{ affiliate_rel }}" data-ga-event="gear_click" data-ga-placement="gift_guide" data-ga-type="amazon_search">{{ g.label }}</a>. {{ g.why }}</li>
  {% endfor %}
</ul>

<h2 id="license">A license is not a store item</h2>
<p>
  Anglers 16 and older generally need a California fishing license. The
  Department of Fish and Wildlife explains the types and how to get one on its
  <a href="{{ cdfw_license_url }}">fishing license page</a>. Check there,
  because rules and fees change. This is a reminder, not legal advice.
</p>

<h2 id="more">More for the day at the water</h2>
<p>
  <a href="{{ root }}gear/">What to bring</a> is a longer packing list for a
  day at a planting water. To see where trout are scheduled,
  <a href="{{ root }}">check this week&rsquo;s schedule</a> or find a water
  <a href="{{ root }}county/">by county</a>. CDFW&rsquo;s own
  <a href="{{ attribution_url }}">Fish Planting Schedule</a> is the source.
</p>
{{ disclosure("gift-disclosure-end") }}
{% endblock %}
